B.KG=s(['Glacier is nicknamed the "Crown of the Continent" for its dramatic glacially carved peaks.',"Going-to-the-Sun Road crosses the Continental Divide and is considered one of the most scenic drives in America.","The park is prime grizzly bear country \u2014 carrying bear spray and making noise on trails is recommended.","Many of the park's namesake glaciers are shrinking, making this a living lesson in climate change."],t.s)
